{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_017TGozunBvbaWWUB3PggqYm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### 5. Pronunciation Guide (Weight: 10%)\n\n**Observed:** 73 pronunciation entries\n\n**Good entries (correctly flagged):**\n- ✅ \"Prospero\" - Italian name, correctly flagged with IPA /prɒˈspɪəroʊ/\n- ✅ \"mummer\" - Unusual term, correctly noted as \"performer in a masquerade\"\n- ✅ \"improvisatori\" - Italian plural, correctly flagged\n- ✅ \"Hernani\" - Literary reference, correctly flagged\n- ✅ \"arabesque\" - French-derived term\n- ✅ \"cerements\" - Archaic burial term\n- ✅ \"habiliments\" - Formal/archaic word\n- ✅ \"candelabrum\" - Latin term\n- ✅ \"out-Heroded\" - Shakespearean reference, correctly noted\n- ✅ Homographs: \"live\", \"close\", \"produce\", \"deliberate\" - all correctly flagged\n\n**False Positives (common words that shouldn't be flagged):**\n- ❌ \"dauntless\" - Standard English word\n- ❌ \"chiming\" - Common word\n- ❌ \"magnificence\" - Common word\n- ❌ \"casements\" - Standard English\n- ❌ \"girdled\", \"massy\", \"ingress\", \"provisioned\", \"buffoons\" - All standard English\n- ❌ \"glaringly\", \"fire-light\", \"minute-hand\" - Common compounds/adverbs\n- ❌ \"reddened\", \"hoarsely\", \"convulsed\" - Common words\n\n**Total false positives:** ~40-50 common words flagged unnecessarily\n\n**Issues:**\n- \"decorum\" flagged as \"foreign\" - It's standard English (Latin-derived but fully assimilated for centuries)\n- \"Avator\" noted as a misspelling of \"avatar\" - good catch, but the note is helpful\n- \"vesture\" missing IPA/phonetic spelling\n- \"unutterable\" missing notes\n\n**Good catches:** The homographs are all correctly identified with context notes.\n\n**Score: 6/10** (Good coverage of genuinely unusual words, but too many false positives on common words, plus a false \"foreign\" flag on \"decorum\")"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_toke